{"seq":3,"slug":"applications","title":"行业应用场景","docCount":3,"url":"/h/data-science/reinforcement-learning-applied/applications","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"sim-to-real-robotics","title":"Sim-to-Real 机器人迁移","url":"/h/data-science/reinforcement-learning-applied/applications/sim-to-real-robotics","wordCount":1619,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"recommendation-systems","title":"推荐系统中的序贯决策","url":"/h/data-science/reinforcement-learning-applied/applications/recommendation-systems","wordCount":1672,"readingTime":7},{"seq":3,"slug":"game-ai-industrial","title":"游戏 AI 与工业控制","url":"/h/data-science/reinforcement-learning-applied/applications/game-ai-industrial","wordCount":1730,"readingTime":7}],"introMarkdown":"# 行业应用场景\n\n本章将前两章的理论与算法落地到三大高价值应用领域：Sim-to-Real 机器人迁移（仿真训练到真实部署的完整技术栈）、推荐与搜索系统中的序贯决策（从贪心排序到长期用户价值优化）、以及游戏 AI 与工业控制（RL 最成熟的商业化方向与新兴制造业应用）。\n\n每篇文档聚焦一个行业的工程实践模式，包含系统架构、典型失败案例、以及经过生产验证的最佳实践。\n"}